sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Skin Manager
  participant RT as Skin Runtime
  participant REG as Registry
  participant HOST as Host Adapter
  participant FX as Effects Runtime
  UI->>RT: preview/apply(skinId)
  RT->>REG: resolve + validate Manifest
  REG-->>RT: validated package
  RT->>HOST: verify DSH compatibility + surfaces
  HOST-->>RT: adapter capabilities
  RT->>RT: preload tokens / CSS / assets
  RT->>HOST: set skin marker + apply tokens
  RT->>FX: mount Effects Profile
  FX-->>RT: handles ready
  RT-->>UI: active / preview ready
  Note over RT,FX: If any stage fails, dispose new handles and restore previous skin
